speechtext:
I can quite see that there could be a figure arrived at in that way. If you are going to have a material reduction 55943-244}
Supply-Labour
in administration, obviously you have to discharge some of your employees or get rid of some of these overhead charges. I venture to say that as a result of this reduction in interest rate from four to three per cent you did not reduce your overhead charges to any appreciable degree. The net result would not be a saving in administration at all.
